<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Basic HTML Tags</title>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>This is a Heading</h1>
    <h2>This is a Subheading</h2>

    <p>This is a paragraph. HTML is used to create web pages.</p>

    <p>
        This text is <b>bold</b>, 
        this is <i>italic</i>, 
        and this is <u>underlined</u>.
    </p>

    <a href="https://www.example.com">This is a link</a>

    <br><br>

    <img src="image.jpg" alt="Sample Image" width="200">

    <hr>

    <ul>
        <li>HTML</li>
        <li>CSS</li>
        <li>JavaScript</li>
    </ul>

    <ol>
        <li>First</li>
        <li>Second</li>
        <li>Third</li>
    </ol>

</body>
</html>
